{"articleNo":"95098","sourceUrl":"https://www.kumoh.ac.kr/ko/sub06_01_01_03.do?mode=view&articleNo=95098&article.offset=0&articleLimit=10","title":"도서관 휴실안내","writer":"국립금오공과대학교","writeDate":"2013.11.19","hit":"3928","attachments":[],"contentHtml":"\n                \t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n                \n                \t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<p class=\"바탕글\">도서관 교육환경개선을 위한 『도서관 냉난방기 설치공사』가 추진됨에 따라 소음발생과 통행에 불편이 예상되므로 다음과 같이 휴실하오니 이용에 참고하시기 바랍니다. </p><p class=\"바탕글\"></p><p class=\"바탕글\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; 1. 기간 : <span style=\"COLOR: #ff0000\" lang=\"EN-US\">2013.11.23(토)~11.24(일)</span></p><p class=\"바탕글\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; 2. 대상&nbsp;:<font color=\"#000000\"> </font><span style=\"COLOR: #0000ff\" lang=\"EN-US\"><font color=\"#000000\">1층 열람실(101호, 104호)</font></span></p><p class=\"바탕글\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; <strong><font color=\"#0900ff\">※2층 열람실(201호)만 이용 가능</font></strong></p><p class=\"바탕글\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;3. 문의 : ☎ 054)478-7167/7168</p><p class=\"바탕글\">&nbsp;</p><p class=\"바탕글\"></p><p class=\"바탕글\"></p><p class=\"바탕글\"></p><p class=\"바탕글\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; 2013. 11. 19.</p><p class=\"바탕글\"></p><p class=\"바탕글\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; 금오공과대학교 도서관장</p>\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n            "}
